対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,92.7 9.1,94.6 14.2,97.2 19.3,95.2 24.5,97.1 29.6,96.9 34.7,95.9 39.8,93.7 44.9,92.5 50.0,91.1 55.1,91.9 60.3,87.3 65.4,88.5 70.5,85.0 75.6,81.0 80.7,81.8 85.8,80.8 91.0,77.2 96.1,74.9 101.2,69.4 106.3,74.3 111.4,73.2 116.5,67.9 121.6,59.1 126.8,58.7 131.9,60.2 137.0,60.2 142.1,68.8 147.2,70.5 152.3,74.8 157.4,74.0 162.6,75.5 167.7,70.2 172.8,65.3 177.9,61.5 183.0,68.2 188.1,70.6 193.2,57.8 198.4,55.4 203.5,53.8 208.6,55.3 213.7,60.5 218.8,53.6 223.9,48.3 229.0,46.6 234.2,40.1 239.3,46.8 244.4,38.8 249.5,30.0 254.6,28.0 259.7,25.8 264.9,21.7 270.0,29.0 275.1,26.3 280.2,18.1 285.3,25.2 290.4,20.2 295.5,15.5 300.7,12.8 305.8,17.6 310.9,15.6 316.0,12.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"12.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,90.5 6.1,90.8 8.3,95.6 10.4,92.2 12.5,93.8 14.7,94.2 16.8,92.0 19.0,94.5 21.1,96.2 23.2,94.2 25.4,95.3 27.5,93.7 29.6,97.2 31.8,96.4 33.9,94.6 36.1,92.7 38.2,92.5 40.3,91.2 42.5,90.4 44.6,92.7 46.7,90.2 48.9,88.8 51.0,86.5 53.2,86.8 55.3,85.6 57.4,83.8 59.6,86.4 61.7,85.